>Meshpoint

Welcome. This Meshpoint runs the optional Reticulum plugin and hosts
this NomadNet page. Customize this introduction for your own node.

NomadNet browsing and LXMF messaging use separate destination hashes
on the same Reticulum identity. Use the LXMF address for messages.

